5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about sustainability. Where do we usually fail after the first year?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to know what our past initiatives actually achieved for patients.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
