11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. We shouldn't add to the pile of forgotten projects.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, durability depends on who is left to do the work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. I will look at the ledger and the booking system.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
