18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also look at the regional fund tariffs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also look at the booking system records.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,Let's see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
