35,2,1,talk,Midori,,The board minutes show a joint clinic failed because neither side held the budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The readmission trial worked, but only while it was actively funded.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Ward vacancies are critical. Agency costs are eating the pay bill.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The development budget is down a quarter. Off-site visits earn no tariff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The car park fills by eleven. The shuttle misses most villages.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, if off-site visits earn nothing, how do we justify them?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, if therapy staff are leaving, can we even staff a unit?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, the midwifery rota has slack, but therapy is empty.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, on-site sessions bill at standard rates. That is the only revenue.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, but the rooms are already booked out from mid-morning.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,The shared nursing round lost a third of visits. That is a risk.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The call-back trial reduced readmissions by a fifth. That is real value.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We cannot add pressure to the wards. We need a different model.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,We need something that bills on-site and doesn't rely on fragile external links.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,We need something that fits in the existing rooms without new infrastructure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,A home visit program seems risky given the tariff and visit completion data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,A day unit needs therapy staff we don't have.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Chronic care coordination might work if it uses existing coordinators.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,Perinatal support uses midwifery slack and bills on-site.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Perinatal support fits in existing rooms and doesn't need new shuttles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
